{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "c00k1e70-0003-4000-a000-000000000003",
    "name": "Cookiepot API — Complete",
    "description": "Every endpoint in the product: 60 across 13 features.\n\n## Setup\n\n```bash\nmongod --dbpath ~/data/mongodb --logpath ~/data/mongolog/mongod.log --fork\ncd backend && pnpm install && pnpm seed:all && pnpm dev\n```\n\n`pnpm seed:all` creates the seven role/status accounts AND loads 24 Nigerian recipes.\n\nRun **Auth → POST /auth/login** first; the token is captured automatically.\n\n## The rules this API is built on\n\n1. **The kitchen is never stock-taken.** Stock moves as a side-effect of cooking and shopping.\n2. **Every claim shows where it came from.** Verified vs AI, always.\n3. **Nothing is auto-committed.** A photo read is reviewed before it counts.\n4. **No request ever waits on a model.** AI work returns a job id immediately.\n5. **Every model answer is checked before it is believed.** A reply that does not fit its schema is rejected, not patched up.\n\n## Error envelope\n\n```json\n{ \"error\": { \"code\": \"account_suspended\", \"message\": \"…\", \"severity\": 40, \"field_errors\": {}, \"rejection_reason\": \"…\" } }\n```\n\nBranch on `code` and nothing else. Display `message` verbatim. `rejection_reason` is an operator diagnostic and is NOT contract.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
